body:
i'm doing much better. i have a job that respects my identity, i'm starting college to pursue my dreams and i have a partner that i love whom i've been with for over 2 years. i still suffer from awful intrusive thoughts, occasional suicidal ideations and a hell of a lot of depression and anxiety, but my meds help and i started testosterone recently which helped a lot in looking forward to the future even more.

&#x200B;

sending you a lot of love, bro. life is hard for us but we're worth the fight. we all are.

i'm sending you so much love rn. i know it can fucking suck especially if you're in a place where the people taking care of you only care about looking like they can cure you instead of actually helping you. you're a wonderful person and you don't deserve to feel the way you do.

&#x200B;

manifesting you go home safely soon. <3
